verb wall_spot_timer_clears "Skullwalltula laughs and turns toward climbing Link is over" by world priority 99 in enemy at 2180 150
  take timer_wall_spot
  unless phase_wall_spot

verb gold_emerge_timer_clears "Gold Skulltula bursts out and leaps is over" by world priority 99 in enemy at 2040 430
  take timer_gold_emerge
  unless phase_gold_emerge

